<title>NORWAY: Phillips to shut Ekofisk for 12 hrs on Aug 30.</title>
<headline>Phillips to shut Ekofisk for 12 hrs on Aug 30.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Phillips Petroleum said on Friday it planned to close the giant Ekofisk complex for 12 hours on August 30 to carry out regular maintenance on the emergency shutdown system.</p>
<p>The shutdown will also affect Amoco's Valhall and Hod platforms.</p>
<p>-- Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
